📝 Changelog - Smart Expense by M/L

All notable changes, feature additions, and bug fixes for Smart Expense by M/L are documented in this file.

[1.4.0] - 2026-08-02

🚀 New Features & Improvements

Real-Time Currency API Integration: Integrated keyless live currency exchange rate fetching from Open ER API (https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/USD).

Real-Time Dynamic Currency Engine: Added an independent IDR (Rp) and USD ($) currency switcher with automated rate conversion across Dashboard metrics, Table, Charts, and CSV export.

Language & Currency Synchronization: Switching language to English (EN) automatically activates USD ($) formatting, while Bahasa Indonesia (ID) activates IDR (Rp) formatting.

[1.3.0] - 2026-08-01

🌐 New Features

Dual Language Support (🇮🇩 ID & 🇬🇧 EN): Complete localization system for interface elements, quick presets, history table, and ML explanation modal.

Dynamic Sample Data: Sample data automatically adjusts descriptions and formatting based on the active language selection.

[1.2.0] - 2026-07-30

🧠 Machine Learning Updates

Massive ML Vocabulary Expansion: Expanded INITIAL_CORPUS memory to over 1,000+ words and pattern tokens covering daily Indonesian & English transactions.

Auto-Upgrade Vocabulary Engine: Initialization logic now checks and automatically upgrades local browser memory if dataset capacity is below 1,000 patterns.

[1.1.0] - 2026-07-28

🎨 UI/UX & Themes

Multi-Theme Engine: Added theme switcher for Light, Dark, and System (Auto) modes.

Responsive Chart Themes: Chart text and gridlines dynamically adjust to match the active color theme.

[1.0.0] - 2026-07-25

🎉 Initial Release

Client-Side Naive Bayes Classifier: 100% browser-based expense classification engine with zero API dependency.

Natural Language Parsing: Automated extraction of numeric shortform patterns (15rb, 50k, 2.5jt).

Voice Input: Speech recognition input powered by Web Speech API.

Visual Analytics: Interactive Doughnut & Bar Charts powered by Chart.js.

Data Export: Transaction history export to .CSV format.